And that is just very much human nature.

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:15.340
So if you're not complaining,

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:17.660
well then I have no advice for you.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.137
I'm pumped, you did it.

00:00:19.137 --> 00:00:20.603
You're in control.

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.080
Don't complain about it,
you've made that choice.

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:25.680
