00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.966
I don't wanna be exposed by myself.

00:00:27.966 --> 00:00:30.557
It's looking yourself in
the mirror and saying,

00:00:30.557 --> 00:00:31.390
"Am I doing this right?"

00:00:31.390 --> 00:00:33.990
So, to me, there's so many people

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:36.600
that are talking shit about
how big of an entrepreneur

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.860
