00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:44.870
I worked every Saturday of my 20s.

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:47.850
I planned to instill
kindness into my kids.

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:52.000
I plan on instilling
perspective into my kids.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.790
I plan in instilling just
being a good human being.

00:00:55.790 --> 00:01:00.260
I plan on making sure they
don't use their parent's wealth

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:05.120
and microfame and leverage to
impose on any other person.

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:06.570
I'm petrified of that.

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:10.480
If my kids try to punk
their friends on my shit,

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:12.910
