00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:30.600
- Do you feel like you judge yourself?

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:31.640
- I don't.

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:33.940
That's a very, very, very good observation

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:36.150
