00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:37.603
We're beating ourselves up.

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:40.010
Everybody sucks

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:41.589
at something.

00:01:41.589 --> 00:01:43.600
We all have shortcomings.

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:44.830
And we all have strengths.

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:47.950
And for me it's like, why
don't we just audit that?

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:49.430
Why don't we just look at it that way

00:01:49.430 --> 00:01:50.740
